{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014CbcoaFKNFgCDxZSN7R81M","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t// .size-limit.js\n2\texport default [\n3\t    {\n4\t        name: 'microtags',\n5\t        path: 'dist/index.min.js',\n6\t        // measured 3.96 kB with server render support moved out of\n7\t        // core (ADR-009) and the typed bind helper; 3.99 kB with the\n8\t        // renderParts static; 4.06 kB with an empty host rendered\n9\t        // through a kept render link (ADR-011); 4.03 kB with comments\n10\t        // counted as content; 4.04 kB skipping define for a tag that\n11\t        // is already registered; 4.04 kB after builder config object\n12\t        // refactor (positional args -> single config); 4.09 kB with\n13\t        // form-associated custom element support (ADR-012); 4.23 kB\n14\t        // with form lifecycle handlers (ctx.form), rounded up to the\n15\t        // next 0.05 kB\n16\t        limit: '4.25 kB',\n17\t    },\n18\t    {\n19\t        name: 'microtags/htm',\n20\t        path: 'dist/htm.min.js',\n21\t        limit: '5 kB',\n22\t    },\n23\t    {\n24\t        name: 'microtags/htm (browser)',\n25\t        path: 'dist/htm.browser.min.js',\n26\t        // measured 4.77 kB after the guarded moveBefore, the duplicate\n27\t        // key check, raw() span adoption, the Markup brand symbol and\n28\t        // the void-element children check; 4.82 kB after the\n29\t        // attribute name guard; 4.94 kB with form controls bound as\n30\t        // DOM properties; 4.99 kB with the adoption mismatch\n31\t        // lookahead; 5.25 kB carrying the server render support\n32\t        // module (ADR-009); 5.29 kB with adopted controls compared\n33\t        // against the server value; 5.31 kB with the lookahead held\n34\t        // inside its range; 5.39 kB with render support building the\n35\t        // host tag from render parts, rounded up to the next 0.05 kB\n36\t        limit: '5.4 kB',\n37\t    },\n38\t    {\n